              %em Towards non-perturbative BV-theory via derived differential geometry
              (2023) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.15106"}> arXiv:2307.15106
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h3#higher_quasicoherent_sheaves Higher quasicoherent sheaves
          %p
            On higher (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorification"}> categorified
